{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-spark","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-spark-esnaad-mbr-district-11-meydan-south","about":"The Spark is a visionary residential project by ESNAAD, nestled in the heart of Mohamed Bin Rashid City, District 11. One and two bedroom apartments are available for sale. The project stands out for its carefully designed apartments, offering the perfect combination of style and functionality. Residences are more than just living spaces; they are the canvas for contemporary living. With logical layouts and careful design, high ceilings and glass facades, every apartment is a testament to our dedication to excellence.The Spark offers a range of community amenities such as a swimming pool, gym, sauna and steam room, co-working space, café, lobby, bike parking and electric vehicle charging stations. With these amenities, residents can seamlessly integrate environmentally conscious living into their daily routine. All of this contributes not only to current environmental values, but also lays the foundation for a greener future.The Spark seamlessly combines the dynamism of the city and modern tranquility. Enjoy attractions within walking distance such as Downtown Dubai, Dubai Mall and DIFC, and stay connected to the city!Discover The Spark by ESNAAD, where every detail opens up a new chapter of modern luxury living.","price":1099000,"title":"The Spark","bitrix":{"id":653,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Spark","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Spark","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"ESNAAD","project_location":"MBR District 11(Meydan South)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1537/images/2024/03/27/340x252/Bg18sqwdf4RRGHS3yLDWCjGlVhP7SAGxplvB5V6I.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1537/images/2024/03/27/464x312/Bg18sqwdf4RRGHS3yLDWCjGlVhP7SAGxplvB5V6